ered repair shop \"Urban Auto Body\". Photos of\ndamage uploaded to claim file.\n2024-03-15 11:22 \u2013 Repair shop supplements damage estimate to $2,450 after discovering deformation\nbehind bumper cover.\n2024-03-18 14:10 \u2013 Insurer requests a copy of the police report and traffic camera footage from the\nmunicipality.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 518, "end_char_idx": 1157, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "dfa84984-2459-44cf-bb6e-51c8bf39c8bc": {"__data__": {"id_": "dfa84984-2459-44cf-bb6e-51c8bf39c8bc", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "hash": "33fe21843453cc971b4b5b90cad12cb3b13ba517bd928ccb83688ee1ed6e8e1a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "18283954-8ad0-42dd-ae39-1ef397590e08", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "applicatio