 overnight rain.\n2023-11-02 06:02 \u2013 Emergency plumber called; identifies leak entering from upper-floor balcony drainage\nbut cannot access neighbor's property.\n2023-11-02 08:55 \u2013 FNOL submitted via call center. Claim categorized as potential weather-related water\nintrusion.\n2023-11-02 13:30 \u2013 Field adjuster scheduled for on-site inspection on 2023-11-04.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1748, "end_char_idx": 2395, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "df1b4026-a70f-4795-adb0-d029ee0a4e19": {"__data__": {"id_": "df1b4026-a70f-4795-adb0-d029ee0a4e19", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "hash": "33fe21843453cc971b4b5b90cad12cb3b13ba517bd928ccb83688ee1ed6e8e1a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "0b9f1d01-53e4-4cd6-a75d-957d3b52a3ec", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "hash": "fbef5fa8aa03db8afb5f81ed45d19f0f70351f4ca1e1a0024314d3f62d4ea258", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Claim categorized as potential weather-related water\nintrusion.\n2023-11-02 13:30 \u2013 Field adjuster scheduled for on-site inspection on 2023-11-04.\n2023-11-04 09:12 \u2013 Adjuster inspection: notes ceiling stains, bubbling paint, damp carpet, and minor mold\nspotting beginning to form.\n2023-11-04 10:27 \u2013 Adjuster verbally advises policyholder to begin drying and mitigation immediately to\navoid additional damage.\n2023-11-05 18:41 \u2013 Policyholder uploads photos of dehumidifiers and fans in use; receipt from local\nequipment rental attached.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 2250, "end_char_idx": 2785, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "d7a70961-1400-4d7b-b586-6e90accb12f3": {"__data__": {"id_": "d7a70961-1400-4d7b-b586-6e90accb12f3", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "d27d61e1-1826-44e0-bd58-d0f7182e07fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midter