a\nsenior medical reviewer, but no new letter is sent to the insured.\n2025-04-15 \u2013 Insured submits an appeal, including a handwritten note from the surgeon stating the\nprocedure was medically necessary to prevent deterioration of the joint.\n2025-05-02 \u2013 Appeal outcome communicated briefly: previous decision upheld, no additional\nreimbursement authorized.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1978, "end_char_idx": 2609, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "dac7e319-7534-450e-9adc-323bb0d33d9b": {"__data__": {"id_": "dac7e319-7534-450e-9adc-323bb0d33d9b", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "d27d61e1-1826-44e0-bd58-d0f7182e07fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "hash": "b189669515e7dba2762154f4ad0f9f4f372205739a355ae6a4e1c6cb34cba809", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "b3417c52-a67e-4ca2-a99b-ce0b98f9e5e7", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "hash": "a6830cf3c5e304009dac30ad1159b7e755f9569b017d05d914bdd9b00da57c33", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "8d7e3a2a-6074-4b44-b648-84dda7aea561", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "696c839fff426ad87c06c3708dfd34d9e4052e82107e6364dd8dfbd7c52574c6", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "2025-05-02 \u2013 Appeal outcome communicated briefly: previous decision upheld, no additional\nreimbursement authorized.\nDetailed Internal Notes and \"Needle\" Data for Case 3\nThe internal notes for Claim #HI-2025-8831 are intentionally sparse and partially fragmented to simulate a\nchallenging real-world file. Several critical details appear only once and are not repeated in summary\ncorrespondence. In a long combined note added on 2025-04-01 at 15:46 by Dr.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 2494, "end_char_idx": 2948, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "8d7e3a2a-6074-4b44-b648-84dda7aea561": {"__data__": {"id_": "8d7e3a2a-6074-4b44-b648-84dda7aea561", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "d27d61e1-1826-44e0-bd58-d0f7182e07fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "hash": "b189669515e7dba2762154f4ad0f9f4f372205739a355ae6a4e1c6cb34cba809", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "dac7e319-7534-450e-9adc-323bb0d33d9b", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/yoni/Documents/midterm assignment/data/insurance_claim_timeline_dataset.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 7638, "creation_date": "2025-12-08", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-08"}, "hash": "b29f7b4efdebe904766d96d25917240b2f46ccef707cd31ef51f0ce71ba2efbc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "ab08d4ce-7371-4d38-8688-f5fbed91e602", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "3476657dc87e784f59d29389fb5a68e65452886699324a77b83e4aa13da4ecf9", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "In a long combined note added on 2025-04-01 at 15:46 by Dr. K. Rahamim (Senior Medical\nReviewer), it is briefly recorded that (a) the patient had previously attempted at least six weeks of\ndocumented physical therapy between 2024-09-10 and 2024-10-29 with limited improvement, (b) the\nout-of-network surgeon actually agreed to charge a reduced fee that is below the plan\u2019s usual and customary\nallowance, and (c) the anesthesia was administered by an in-network anesthesiologist whose tax ID is\nmistakenly listed under the clinic\u2019s out-of-network billing header. These details are buried in a paragraph that\nalso includes unrelated remarks about document formatting and are never referenced again.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 2889, "end_char_idx": 3585, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\