gh-level decision letters might incorrectly conclude that the surgery was\nelective, overpriced, and fully out-of-network, even though the underlying note suggests both prior\nconservative treatment and partial in-network participation.\nFor analytical tasks, this case is intended to test the ability to:\n- Reconstruct the full clinical justification from scattered notes over time.\n- Identify misclassified provider network status hidden in narrative comments.\n- Detect that a key time range (2024-09-10 to 2024-10-29 physical therapy) is never summarized in the\nfinal decision.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 3451, "end_char_idx": 4208, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}, "docstore/metadata": {"cb9a6da5-24db-4f47-820e-359e77b5a3df": {"doc_hash": "c22c7ef31c2e58007a4847ee4551d6e954366ad12f5620adf397bd622c9e8ca8", "ref_doc_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1"}, "18283954-8ad0-42dd-ae39-1ef397590e08": {"doc_hash": "d39211944c867c0c55e4f6ed655675ad3109b651392e8e0ec85113b8a2b2ed2b", "ref_doc_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1"}, "dfa84984-2459-44cf-bb6e-51c8bf39c8bc": {"doc_hash": "e3dd2c8486696b6bd4c4b01560440822a5c872c12f31d7f8cf609f35eed5c26e", "ref_doc_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1"}, "3736eb9a-2953-4799-98a8-df6ea97bd4b7": {"doc_hash": "171aaab1156c2c853e8dc88f34e0a2083d83dc21b7e51a88db7f709204ce35e1", "ref_doc_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1"}, "0b9f1d01-53e4-4cd6-a75d-957d3b52a3ec": {"doc_hash": "fbef5fa8aa03db8afb5f81ed45d19f0f70351f4ca1e1a0024314d3f62d4ea258", "ref_doc_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1"}, "df1b4026-a70f-4795-adb0-d029ee0a4e19": {"doc_hash": "b81d02b9dbbc0e6d9616fa01e55495deb168d48ac59e6ada95164844e512963c", "ref_doc_id": "43769b52-05ac-4301-bb20-0c53b0ffd8c1"}, "d7a70961-1400-4d7b-b586-6e90accb12f3": {"doc_hash": "6b2c0df59596ec8921302a06664d72a7634c3accb008369ad90001528cee28c9", "ref_doc_id": "d27d6